message: If you use or refer to this project, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: "matriarch-firmware-fixes: Unofficial bug fixes for the Moog Matriarch firmware v1.3.0"
abstract: "Unofficial bug fixes for the Moog Matriarch synthesizer's firmware v1.3.0, the last release before the Matriarch was discontinued. A browser-based patcher and command-line tools apply the fixes to the user's own copy of Moog's firmware file. Fixes include the paraphonic mixer gate length and HOLD sending sustain while the Arp/Seq is playing. The repository also documents the firmware format and how the fixes work. It contains no Moog firmware and isn't affiliated with Moog Music."
